				'Ferry' ,'WaterShuttle'                 ,'Zuid_Holland'  ,''                                   ,''                     ,'9.75'  ,'0'     ,'0'      ,'veer Rotterdam Erasmusbrug-Kinderdijk (Qbuzz-branding) | bron: https://watershuttle.nl/en/rotterdam-kinderdijk/ [feed: vh. Watertaxi Rotterdam]'
